## **📊 How the Coordinate Log appears in the database**

```sql
CREATE TABLE ten_d_coordinate_log (
    id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    node_id TEXT NOT NULL,
    step_index BIGINT NOT NULL,
    direction TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (direction IN ('forward','inverse')),
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),
    state_vector DOUBLE PRECISION[] NOT NULL CHECK (cardinality(state_vector)=10),
    delta_axis TEXT,
    delta_value DOUBLE PRECISION,
    reversible_error DOUBLE PRECISION
);
```

This schema ensures:

- strict ordering  
- complete state capture  
- replay‑safe persistence  

